### Complete Guide to Input Types a Website Can Support

A website can accept data through HTML forms, URLs, APIs, files, browser interactions, network requests, and external integrations.

There is no finite list of every possible input because developers can create custom input formats. However, the following is a comprehensive classification of the major input types you should understand as an offensive security researcher.

